	(descr "2.0 in 240x320 ST7789 IPS TFT module, Golden Morning GMT020-02-8P (sold as XIITIA), 37.25 x 62 mm, on a 1x8 2.54 mm header. Pins 1 BL, 2 CS, 3 DC, 4 RST, 5 SDA, 6 SCL, 7 VCC, 8 GND, the same order as st7789_154in_240x240 (the module marks GND with its square pad). Module outline, corner holes (about 2.5 mm) and active area on Dwgs.User; courtyard is the whole module. Header offset and holes measured from photos: check with calipers.")
